OL,3,AAnthropic shares expected to jump at
OL,4,Astart of trading as AI firm makes stock
OL,5,Amarket debut
OL,6,
OL,7,FAI firm Anthropic is listed publicly
OL,8,Ffor the first time, with the stock
OL,9,Fmarket in New York now open
OL,11,FAccording to data from the Nasdaq,
OL,12,Fshare prices are set to open at $110, a
OL,13,Fsteep jump from the $83 set last night
OL,14,F- take a closer look at some of the
OL,15,Fnumbers here
OL,17,FTrading hasn't started yet - but it's
OL,18,Fexpected to begin soon, as market
OL,19,Fapetite appears strong
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
