OL,3,AAnthropic shares expected to jump at
OL,4,Astart of trading as AI firm makes stock
OL,5,Amarket debut
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe company behind AI product Claude
OL,8,Fwas valued at $1.5tn (#1.14tn) after
OL,9,Fraising a record $81bn ahead of its
OL,10,Fstock market debut
OL,12,FThe flotation is being seen as a
OL,13,Fcrucial test for the AI sector, with
OL,14,FAnthropic the first purely AI-focused
OL,15,Ffirm to sell shares publicly
OL,17,FThe seven founders who set up Anthropic
OL,18,Fin 2021 will become multi-billionaires
OL,19,F- we've looked at why private companies
OL,20,Fdecide to sell shares publicly here
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
